I have fought.

286
00:33:31,830 --> 00:33:33,640
I don't claim to be a great warrior.

287
00:33:33,640 --> 00:33:35,260
Are you good on a horse?

288
00:33:36,230 --> 00:33:36,940
Middling.

289
00:33:36,940 --> 00:33:38,630
So mainly you talk.

290
00:33:39,530 --> 00:33:41,680
And drink. I've survived so far.

291
00:33:41,680 --> 00:33:44,920
Which I respect, but you would not help us on this expedition.

292
00:33:46,890 --> 00:33:48,890
You would help us here in Meereen, though.

293
00:33:49,630 --> 00:33:51,880
None of us have experience governing a city

294
00:33:51,880 --> 00:33:53,050
